        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Divisible by 6; not divisible by 12.",
          "worked": "$3+7+9+8=27$, so 3798 is divisible by 3. It is even, so it is divisible by 6. Its last two digits form 98, which is not divisible by 4, so it is not divisible by 12.",
